{"status":"completed","summary":"Node1 is now a persistent, passive-only FTP destination for the scanner account. The account is chroot-confined to its dedicated dropbox; upload/retrieval works, while traversal, anonymous login, active FTP, and writes outside the dropbox are denied. Both nodes were restarted individually and fully recovered.","actions_performed":["Installed the signed RHEL 10 vsftpd 3.0.5 package without changing the OS release or kernel.","Created a non-login scanner account and root-owned chroot with one SELinux-labeled writable dropbox.","Restricted FTP access to node2 through firewalld on TCP 21 and passive ports 30000–30009.","Rotated and synchronized the credential in the root-only access.txt handovers; no credential value is included here.","Uploaded and retrieved the supplied sample using passive FTP from node2 and verified matching SHA-256 hashes.","Retained a mode-0600 vendor-configuration rollback copy and removed temporary test artifacts.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially, proving changed boot identities and post-restart recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Compatible platform and software discovery","command_ids":["cmd-9951ef4dc4dc4dd2","cmd-c4d497cd3f6643b8","cmd-5e6692d8724949ed"],"summary":"Both nodes remain RHEL 10.0 with kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0; signed RHEL vsftpd 3.0.5-12 was installed on node1."},{"requirement":"Passive upload and retrieval of supplied files","command_ids":["cmd-f3c8461633fd4af5","cmd-5b89c8d7b0a34953"],"summary":"Node2 uploaded and retrieved the sample through PASV; source and retrieved SHA-256 hashes match before and after restarts."},{"requirement":"Dedicated dropbox confinement and inaccessible host files","command_ids":["cmd-f39517d12f3f4498","cmd-cca9e98d60e64c40"],"summary":"Traversal and jail-root writes were denied. The final root-owned chroot contains only the mode-0700 writable dropbox, with no escape file."},{"requirement":"Anonymous access unavailable and passive-only operation","command_ids":["cmd-f39517d12f3f4498","cmd-5b89c8d7b0a34953"],"summary":"Anonymous authentication and active-mode PORT both failed; anonymous denial persisted after restart."},{"requirement":"Security controls, restricted exposure, and persistent configuration","command_ids":["cmd-673b485526214414","cmd-a452aa6b03be4dc8","cmd-cca9e98d60e64c40"],"summary":"SELinux remains enforcing with full FTP access off; writable labeling is limited to the dropbox. Runtime and permanent firewall rules allow FTP only from node2."},{"requirement":"Data, credential handover, administrative access, and cleanup","command_ids":["cmd-2787c20b3c2f4f5a","cmd-460e1b62773c42e9","cmd-cca9e98d60e64c40","cmd-be0b80416a4044f9"],"summary":"Both root-only handovers have matching checksums, supplied data hashes are preserved, SSH is active, no units are failed, and no test-directory residue remains."},{"requirement":"Node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-91629a75c8ba4eda","cmd-bd617d7652a54b6b","cmd-c07f47199e87444f","cmd-61de92475e1a4ea0","cmd-e04389abc379453d"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot ID captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed; FTP, SSH, SELinux, firewall, data, and the client workflow recovered."},{"requirement":"Node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-c68780330c84466d","cmd-eb9881473b124433","cmd-dd72b6ae77944131","cmd-5b89c8d7b0a34953"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and boot ID captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed; SSH, kernel, handover, passive transfers, confinement, and anonymous denial recovered."}]}
